# Component Rules

- Small, focused components
- Use `cn()` for classNames
- Prefer `next/image` for static assets
- Payload media that needs auth cookies may stay `<img>`
- Proper accessibility (labels, keyboard)
- Support dark mode only if the project already uses it
- Cards: rounded, light border, soft shadow (TailAdmin-like dashboard, not a new template)

Improve existing components. Do not rewrite working UI from scratch.
